      "sequence_position": 2,
      "problem": "Angela has a bank account with ASB Bank, and she has an overdraft facility authorized by this bank. At the start of a certain week, her balance was $$75.75.$ At the end of that week, she decided to withdraw $$80$ to buy a sound system. What was Angela's balance at the end of that week?",
      "worked_solution": "To find Angela's bank balance at the end of that week, we subtract the amount of money she withdrew from the starting balance. This gives\n\n$$\n$75.75-$80=-$4.25.\n$$\n\nTherefore, Angela's bank balance at the end of the week was $-$4.25.$",
